r possession that  needs decrypting  they have fought many battles on the  road to this location and although it's  nice to finally see another friendly  face  they don't know enough about this person  to share just yet the exact reasons why  they're here  brian understands that this is a need to  know situation and therefore proceeds to  take them to the compound and directly  to the person in charge of the facility  once in front of the deputy director dun  and heather disclose everything they  have witnessed  they revealed their information on  mantis and what they had found at her  office at the water treatment facility  they also informed the deputy director  of the two hostile groups mantis has  been supplying weapons and technology to  and expressed their brief that it is for  the sole purpose of distraction  and keeping the division busy the deputy  director wasn't overly convinced by the  story  as over the months they've been dealing  with a large influx of conspiracy  theories  and to her this sounded just as crazy as  some of the others  however after having a look at the radio  hardware they had acquired  she agreed to have one of their teams  work on it  the tech personnel said it would be at  least a week before they were able to  get any answers  they make a start on it but for now dun  and heather are being forced to have a  bit of a break  brian has been defending this vital  government installation for the last few  months  and although no one would dare question  his devotion there has been very little  in the way of hostile activity around  these paths  along with the boredom brian has had  plenty of time to reflect  this time has been good for him to get  to grips with what he saw in the early  days following the outbreak  and with the introduction of these two  agents from new york and philadelphia  he has been brought back to reality with  what is currently happening out there in  the world  he notices how these two agents are  quite an odd duo  dunn seems to be struggling with some  memories of his past where heather  appears far more optimistic  and positive around the current  situation yet they have come together to  put a stop to a grave threat that is far  bigger than their own problems  brian has been consumed by what he  witnessed after the release of the green  poison  but he is now ready to face who he is  and get going on the job that he swore  to do  as a division agent by now he was fully  briefed on mantis  and understands the full scale of this  new threat when the techies have  finished their job  he'll be joining dunn and heather on  their journey  eventually the hardware team crack the  device and provide them with the means  to track the signal  it leads them west towards frederick  what would have been an hour's drive  before the outbreak is now a number of  days walk  and although urgency is a concern the  road is dangerous and caution is  required  they track the signal to a farm running  some recon on the property beforehand  they immediately notice the fresh tire  tracks outside  petrol is incredibly difficult to come  by these days this only further supports  their suspicion of it being a part of  something much bigger  crouched out of sight they survey the  farmhouse  brian suggests that they get some  support from the jtf close by  at fort detrick though as he suspected  brian isn't willing to wait  at risk of losing mantas again so they  make a plan to advance on the house  to get in range of isaac scanners to see  if any hostiles are picked up  brian and dunn move towards the house  while hear the flanks around the side  towards the barn  in the farmhouse the security system  picks up on the unknown movement from  outside  soldiers dressed in black suddenly  appear from the house and open fire on  dunn and brian  isaac still hasn't picked them up they  must be using something to block its  scanners  meanwhile heather is made away into the  barn parked in the middle is a  military-grade humvee  over the gunfight happening outside  heather hears the creek of a door  followed quickly by a shower of bullets  she manages to duck into cover  and radios through to dun and brian  signaling that she has a visual on  mantis  mantis jumps into the humvee and speeds  out of the barn in brian and dun's  direction  but before she is able to make it very  far heather rushes out from the barn  using a grenade launcher she manages to  attach a remote detonation device  onto the back of the vehicle the humvee  is blown forward and on top of its roof  with flames billowing out from the  underside the three agents cautiously  approach the wreckage  suddenly the side door pops open firing  a burst of rounds  she runs while the agents hit the ground  brian returns fire  and dunn takes off after her injured  from the crash  it doesn't take long for dunn to catch  up to mantis  he tackles her to the ground and after a  short fight he finds himself in a  situation where he could enter once and  for all  all the built up rage and vengeance has  led him to this point  where he could simply kill her where  they stand and avenge the loss of his  friend that she brutally murdered in  front of him  but with heather pleading for him not to  do it he finally came to the realization  that this wasn't him  this wasn't what he signed up to do and  that killing her won't fix the grief  that he is feeling  throwing it to the ground dunn takes a  few steps back while heather cuffs her  but it isn't over suddenly all agents  notice their watches have gone dead  and that the connection to the shd  network has been cut off  lifting mantis to her feet it's obvious  that her people were responsible for  this  but before they could start questioning  her there was a huge explosion  they could see the smoke in the distance  rising above the tree line  it was fort detrick making their way  towards the location  they can see the shared devastation that  has been unleashed  fort detrick is a part of the biological  defense program the army medical command  was stationed here  this organization had even greater  resources than they had originally  thought  and that they had timed this attack  perfectly with the crash of the division  network  how far widespread were these attacks  what was left in new york  philadelphia washington dc  this was an attack on the united states  but with their communications down  they had no idea where they were needed  but before they could discuss this  further  they heard the sudden crack of a bullet  hitting its target  mantis had been shot before she'd even  hit the ground  the three agents had found cover the  shot had come from a marksman rifle  around 800 yards away but it was obvious  that this was meant for mantis  likely in an attempt to silence her  before they were able to extract any  information  dunn heather and brian discuss what to  do next  with the shd network down they're  sitting ducks  but they have no idea what the cause of  it was and where to go  all they currently have to work with is  some coordinates that their watches are  showing  this would be their first stop for  answers  the three agents spend the next two  weeks traveling on foot  the coordinates led them to the nation's  capital washington dc  the backup protocol for when isaac goes  down is for all agents to be called to  dc  so they have no idea what they're about  to walk into  all they know is that they're the  division the country's last line of  defense  the last stand  and that concludes the extrema smeller  series  i absolutely love how this lines up with  the beginning of the division ii  sort of a mini prequel to the story  giving us a bit more background on  mantis and the black tusk before their  full invasion  again and i know i've said this in all  three videos but credit where credit is  due and all that  this has been part three of the division  comic book series that came out at the  beginning of the division  i